{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2023-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1695427200, "end_date": 1696118399, "month_true_total": 1464, "quota": 13, "returned": 13, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:54:07 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "147394060", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968731843", "personaname": "QuarK", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197968731843/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 6813, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5293, "last_played": 1718730825, "avatar": "590451214d35ea7a9fbeda4ef22748218a81033a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played this game with a buddy.  Finished it with my buddy too!  Enjoyed every minute of it, maybe we'll even play it again in the future as it has such great replay value...", "timestamp_created": 1696116318, "timestamp_updated": 1696116318, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147391413", "author": {"steamid": "76561199381762601", "personaname": "Talent", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/abzrtz/", "num_games_owned": 335, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 5078, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4048, "last_played": 1738388987, "avatar": "d7626ca2762300b61d2a158194e257274b6c0413"}, "language": "english", "review": "I certainly recommend this game to those who are looking for something different. If you like dark souls and shooters, this game is for you! It's challenging which is why I enjoyed it, and if you choose to play with friends its get more challenging the more people that join. Everyone's experience will be different and each path you choose offers different rewards. Don't sweat it if you miss an item or weapon either because there is a re-roller implemented into the game to go back to different worlds and roll them to acquire different items. 10/10 for sure! Time to go play the first one!!", "timestamp_created": 1696112849, "timestamp_updated": 1696112849, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147390086", "author": {"steamid": "76561199017952239", "personaname": "Watermelon \"Side Part\" Philips", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199017952239/", "num_games_owned": 52, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 2795, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2625, "last_played": 1773110760, "avatar": "0a8c7427c8a1869b0357d0d4bd07c10fd71270fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game. Summoner best class. um yeah", "timestamp_created": 1696111285, "timestamp_updated": 1696111285, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147385500", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974833855", "personaname": "Xzeptie", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xzeptie/", "num_games_owned": 160, "num_reviews": 83, "playtime_forever": 1654, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1081, "last_played": 1708629892, "avatar": "0dd067541e5af55e306bcd8dcc3f33fc2309e409"}, "language": "english", "review": "Big piece of advise: if you have an HDR monitor like i do, please use SpecialK as the game does not have native HDR. Its baffling that this is not included in 2023. It makes the game look so much better!\n\nAnyway:\nReally amazing game. Tons of replay value. You cannot see or get everything from 1 playthrough.\nI love the dual archetype gameplay, and all the secrets you can uncover. If you dont look for them the game can seem a little bare. But trust me, you will want to get the secret stuff.", "timestamp_created": 1696106347, "timestamp_updated": 1696185891, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147381612", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039961291", "personaname": "ReptileGenetix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039961291/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 112, "playtime_forever": 543, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 543, "last_played": 1696102444, "avatar": "a8091fa7e1c73cf1289ef49f74e105e0c0f5562f"}, "language": "english", "review": "4/10", "timestamp_created": 1696102568, "timestamp_updated": 1696102568, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.387394309043884277", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147381215", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069951622", "personaname": "MattyTheGiant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198069951622/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 1274, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 227, "last_played": 1717925485, "avatar"