}, {"recommendationid": "147365559", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006432964", "personaname": "Lamb of God", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006432964/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 10213, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8103, "last_played": 1714932554, "avatar": "d10c04efef73fb0ac287cab10dcf0ef1a859c5c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is a nice souls-like with guns, I enjoyed it a lot, even got as far as getting all achievements, which is something that I don't usually do, just with games that I really like, usually FromSoft titles. Also, in case anyone wondered, it is completely soloable, including getting all achievements, so if you want to get at it alone, have no doubt, with some clever gameplay it is completely doable. That being said, you do have to upgrade your weapons and spend time learning the ropes of the game. \n\nThe game is also full of secrets, many of which it is almost impossible to discover on your own, so I definitely recommend you watch some guides on Remnant 2 secrets, because it would be a great shame to miss out on some of them.", "timestamp_created": 1696088475, "timestamp_updated": 1696088475, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}